@NotificationService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5004

### Health Check
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Send / Process Notification (New Route)
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "OrderConfirmed",
  "userId": "USER_123",
  "orderId": "ORD_999",
  "message": "Your order has been confirmed and is being processed."
}

### Send / Process Notification (v1 Route)
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "OrderShipped",
  "userId": "USER_123",
  "orderId": "ORD_999",
  "message": "Your order has been shipped."
}
